---

<Layout>
  <Page>
    <PageHeader>
      <slot slot="title">Peer Exchanges</slot>
      <slot slot="description">
        <p>
          The ITS PCB Program facilitates peer exchanges to allow practitioners
          to share knowledge, experiences, and best practices with one another.
          These knowledge transfer events may be conducted as in-person or
          virtual events that cover a variety of topics related to intelligent
          transportation systems (ITS) and emerging transportation technologies.
        </p>
        <p>
          If your agency is interested in conducting a peer exchange, please
          contact the ITS PCB Program at <Link
            href="mailto:itspcb@dot.gov"
            isExternal>itspcb@dot.gov</Link
          >.
        </p>
      </slot>
    </PageHeader>
